# Secrets and local environment configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/secrets/
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Private keys, certificates, and signing material
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.mobileprovision

# Tooling and operating-system output
.DS_Store
*.log
.expo/
.vercel/
.idea/
.vscode/

# JavaScript / Expo build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Python build output and virtual environments
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
